        "TileImage": "$($repository 52cfd5fd-b9b9-454a-8c7c-8a218501d3b4).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.\r\rYour main target is Elsie J. Peterson, one of the Ark Society’s finest members. That being said, it would appear she’s gotten herself into quite the situation. While we haven’t been told the full details of her scheme, we have been entrusted with bringing it Crashing Down on her. While you’re at it, the client wishes you to deal with her co-conspirators; Bryant, Carlisle (No Relation to THOSE Carlisles), Watts, and Welch.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare, 47.\r\r-ChannelJoined",
